  m_Name: L5_ShadowGoodEndPhase_3.5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Lines:
  - (His voice is tiny now, no longer booming. He is sitting on the edge of the bench,
    looking at his hands.)
  - Oh... I see. The light... it doesn't hurt as much as I thought it would. You
    really are going to do it.
  - "You\u2019re going to walk out of the gate."
  - But before that... Can you come talk to me?
